Package: inlaops
Title: MLOps and tidymodels Bridge for inlabru Models
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Novica", "Nakov", , "novica.nakov@vetinst.no", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0005-7773-7718")),
    person("Norwegian Veterinary Institute", role = c("cph", "fnd"))
  )
Description: Provides vetiver and tidymodels integration for Bayesian spatial
    and latent Gaussian models fit with inlabru. Includes a vetiver bridge
    (versioning, REST API serving, Docker packaging) for 'bru' objects, broom
    tidiers, a parsnip model constructor scoped to fixed-effects models, and
    proper scoring rule helpers via inlabru::generate().
